    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internet culture!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mocks new and old internet culture by making enemies that represent the worst of their subculture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge and hit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you perfectly dodge a attack you counterattack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/92761d93586ce2aea65da836a16655ce.poster.avif?t=1746253036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/92761d93586ce2aea65da836a16655ce.webm?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/92761d93586ce2aea65da836a16655ce.mp4?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradual HP loss for you and enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if your HP is red, do not panic! you can heal yourself if your HP is not 0, but enemies can so do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/0c05d10c3caa4c55881dcedb5b2586d9.poster.avif?t=1746253036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/0c05d10c3caa4c55881dcedb5b2586d9.webm?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/0c05d10c3caa4c55881dcedb5b2586d9.mp4?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Without pretentious themes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know these type of games, so we decided not using pretentious themes!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internet culture!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mocks new and old internet culture by making enemies that represent the worst of their subculture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge and hit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you perfectly dodge a attack you counterattack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/92761d93586ce2aea65da836a16655ce.poster.avif?t=1746253036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/92761d93586ce2aea65da836a16655ce.webm?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/92761d93586ce2aea65da836a16655ce.mp4?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradual HP loss for you and enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if your HP is red, do not panic! you can heal yourself if your HP is not 0, but enemies can so do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/0c05d10c3caa4c55881dcedb5b2586d9.poster.avif?t=1746253036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/0c05d10c3caa4c55881dcedb5b2586d9.webm?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345590/extras/0c05d10c3caa4c55881dcedb5b2586d9.mp4?t=1746253036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr